"s4\">📷</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p4\" style=\"margin: 9px 0px 8px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"><img src=\"/images/blogs/kosaka.nao/2020-01-08/32224_0.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_1925.jpeg\"></span></p><p class=\"p4\" style=\"margin: 9px 0px 8px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"><img src=\"/images/blogs/kosaka.nao/2020-01-08/32224_1.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_2031.jpeg\"></span></p><p class=\"p4\" style=\"margin: 9px 0px 8px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"><img src=\"/images/blogs/kosaka.nao/2020-01-08/32224_2.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_2164.jpeg\"></span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 9px 0px 8px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\"><img src=\"/images/blogs/kosaka.nao/2020-01-08/32224_3.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_1874.jpeg\"></span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 9px 0px 8px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\"><img src=\"/images/blogs/kosaka.nao/2020-01-08/32224_4.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_1894.jpeg\"></span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 9px 0px 8px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\"><img src=\"/images/blogs/kosaka.nao/2020-01-08/32224_5.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_1782.jpeg\"></span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\">それっぽくカメラ<ruby>持<rt>も</rt></ruby>ってるの<ruby>面白<rt>おもしろ</rt></ruby>い。<ruby>笑<rt>えみ</rt></ruby></span></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\">これ<ruby>全<rt>すべ</rt></ruby>てお<ruby>兄<rt>にい</rt></ruby>ちゃんが<ruby>撮<rt>と</rt></ruby>ってくれました</span><span class=\"s1\">( ¨̮ )</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"><ruby>仲<rt>なか</rt></ruby>いいんですよ、びっくりでしょ。<ruby>笑<rt>えみ</rt></ruby></span></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\">こんな<ruby>感<rt>かん</rt></ruby>じで<ruby>楽<rt>たの</rt></ruby>しいお<ruby>正月<rt>しょうがつ</rt></ruby><ruby>休<rt>やす</rt></ruby>みを<ruby>過<rt>す</rt></ruby>ごせました♪</span></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\">メッセージとかでも、<ruby>撮<rt>と</rt></ruby>った<ruby>写真<rt>しゃしん</rt></ruby>まだ<ruby>載<rt>の</rt></ruby>せてない<ruby>分<rt>ぶん</rt></ruby><ruby>送<rt>おく</rt></ruby>るかもなので</span><span class=\"s3\">😊</span></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\">さて、もうほとんどの<ruby>方<rt>ほう</rt></ruby>がお<ruby>仕事<rt>しごと</rt></ruby><ruby>始<rt>はじ</rt></ruby>まってますよね、<ruby>学校<rt>がっこう</rt></ruby>も</span></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"><ruby>私<rt>わたし</rt></ruby>も<ruby>今年<rt>ことし</rt></ruby>で<ruby>高校<rt>こうこう</rt></ruby><ruby>三<rt>さん</rt></ruby><ruby>年生<rt>ねんせい</rt></ruby>になるんですよ。</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"><ruby>自分<rt>じぶん</rt></ruby>でも<ruby>信<rt>しん</rt></ruby>じられない</span><span class=\"s3\">😶</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"><ruby>加入<rt>かにゅう</rt></ruby>した<ruby>時<rt>とき</rt></ruby>は<ruby>中学<rt>ちゅうがく</rt></ruby><ruby>三<rt>さん</rt></ruby><ruby>年生<rt>ねんせい</rt></ruby>だったのにね</span><span class=\"s1\">~</span></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"><ruby>今年<rt>ことし</rt></ruby>もお<ruby>仕事<rt>しごと</rt></ruby>と<ruby>勉強<rt>べんきょう</rt></ruby>、どっちも<ruby>頑張<rt>がんば</rt></ruby>っていきたいと<ruby>思<rt>おも</rt></ruby>います！</span></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"><ruby>抱負<rt>ほうふ</rt></ruby>は<ruby>恥<rt>は